  'Blocks, keyframes and Flipbook frames are retimed to keep their length in seconds. This can shift cuts by a frame. Undo restores them.': "Blokke, nøglebilleder og flipbook-billeder tidsjusteres for at beholde deres længde i sekunder. Det kan flytte klip et billede. Fortryd gendanner dem.",
