  'If another AI program on this computer wants to change your {noun}, {app} asks you first in a box in the middle of the window. Choose Deny, Allow once or Always allow. You can change your answer later under Outside agents in the menu here.': "Hvis et andet AI-program på denne computer vil ændre din {noun}, spørger {app} dig først i en boks midt i vinduet. Vælg Afvis, Tillad én gang eller Tillad altid. Du kan ændre dit svar senere under \"Eksterne agenter\" i menuen her.",
  'If the app cannot start, a message says why and where the engine keeps its log.': "Hvis appen ikke kan starte, siger en besked hvorfor, og hvor motoren gemmer sin log.", 'Installed in the data folder ({size} MB).': "Installeret i datamappen ({size} MB).", 'It asked to {what}.': "Dens anmodning: {what}.",
